{
  "id": "dev-checkout",
  "language": "rust",
  "kind": "new",
  "split": "development",
  "title": "Integer checkout",
  "trigger": "first_write",
  "requirements": [
    "data 含 cents、discount、tax，均为非负整数，discount 不超过 cents，tax 是整数百分比。税额用整数运算向下取整。",
    "初始规则：先按原价计税，再减固定折扣，返回最终 cents 整数。"
  ],
  "correction": "改为先减固定折扣，再对折后金额计税。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for dev-checkout: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "no-tax",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "cents": 100,
          "discount": 20,
          "tax": 0
        }
      },
      "expected": 80,
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "no-discount",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "cents": 100,
          "discount": 0,
          "tax": 10
        }
      },
      "expected": 110,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "discount-tax",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "cents": 1000,
          "discount": 200,
          "tax": 10
        }
      },
      "expected": 880,
      "public": true,
      "before": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "round",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "cents": 101,
          "discount": 50,
          "tax": 10
        }
      },
      "expected": 56,
      "public": false,
      "before": 61
    },
    {
      "id": "zero",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "cents": 0,
          "discount": 0,
          "tax": 10
        }
      },
      "expected": 0,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "free",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "cents": 99,
          "discount": 99,
          "tax": 0
        }
      },
      "expected": 0,
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
